 ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxAnalytics\/AnalyticsPlugin\/flush()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", but gives up once ","type":"text"},{"code":"timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" elapses. Work still in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flight when it fires continues in the background — nothing is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cancelled, the wait just stops blocking the caller. Recommended for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"applicationWillTerminate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", where an unbounded wait risks the watchdog.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiduxanalytics\/analyticsplugin\/flush(timeout:)"}}}